                <pb facs="0601" n="489" xml:id="pg489"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Combs to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-07-18"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">July 18, 1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Had an interview with President of Peru and minister for foreign affairs of Peru
                    at their request this afternoon, to explain the effect of congressional action
                    required in protocol. Convinced them such action wise and necessary. Both
                    undertook unequivocal and hearty approval and support of protocol.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Combs.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
